OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader defends Market Hall
OL,4,Aafter criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Derby City Council has
OL,7,Fdefended the city's #35m Market Hall
OL,8,Fafter an internal review found it
OL,9,Fopened without "clear commercial
OL,10,Fobjectives" or a comprehensive
OL,11,Fmarketing plan.
OL,13,FThe report criticised aspects of the
OL,14,Fmanagement, strategy and lack of
OL,15,Ffootfall when the Victorian venue
OL,16,Freopened in May 2025 following a major
OL,17,Frefurbishment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
