OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader defends Market Hall
OL,4,Aafter criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Nadine Peatfield said the findings
OL,7,F"needed to be viewed in the context" of
OL,8,Fthe challenges facing the project and
OL,9,Finsisted significant improvements had
OL,10,Falready been made to date.
OL,12,F"We were up against the wire for
OL,13,Fopening day, so we learnt our lessons
OL,14,Fvery quickly, we've implemented the
OL,15,Fchanges and we're looking forward to
OL,16,Fthe future," she said.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
